        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpectedly, you click on a link to a “The Game That Dies When You Play It” you was posted on a certain bulletin board. When you start up the game, you encounter a warning of “Escape” and a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to avoid death...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Flow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the desktop horror adventure game. The virtual desktop contains a game, a browser, and several applications. You will seek ways to avoid death by using not only the game but also various information displayed on your desktop and browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is FPS perspective. You will use items such as knives and lighters to clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846720/extras/06bd7503dee8f43f752c21aad4912b8b.avif?t=1763874527\" width=1002 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three endings: Bad, Normal, and True.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
